"P3334015180" "Parcel"
// DetailString :
"P3301388037" "You were given this parcel by Praetor Sinclair to deliver to a propaganda officer outside of the TPN building."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1924924935" "Did you know that there is over a sixty percent chance that you are a Resistance spy, {HeroName}?<br><br>I know, staggering number, isn't it? It just... takes your breath away. It's remarkable to think that there would be so many people unhappy with all that Cole has given them.<br><br>Which brings me to my request of you. The Propaganda Officer at TPN is waiting for my latest 'Official Intelligence' on how deeply rooted this 'Resistance' effort truly is. I want you to deliver the data to him."
// AcceptString :
"P1347613719" "Deliver the data."
// SendOffString :
"P4005077926" "It's a simple errand, you shouldn't run into any problems."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2480296718" "Deliver parcel to Propaganda Officer."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4085023539" "I believe I assigned you a relatively simple task. Perform it. Now."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3084932094" "Get {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3099638174" "You've been given a parcel."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2352960398" "May I help you?<br><br>Oh! Praetor Sinclair sent you? Well I hope you have that data.<br><br>Excellent. Why it took Sinclair's office so long to get this too me is beyond me."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P455725549" "You performed precisely according to my calculations, {HeroName}. Oh, the ambush? Yes, I knew that the Resistance was going to attempt to steal the data parcel, just like I also knew that you would successfully fight them off to prove your loyalty. By the way, it is still in question.<br><br>At any rate, the focus of this operation was not to get files to the Propaganda Officer, nor was it to test your loyalty. It was to test the loyalty of Sandra Peters, and unfortunately for her, she failed the test.<br><br>You see, {HeroName}, things are not always as they seem. The Resistance understands this, they even embrace it, and so do I. While everyone was fixated on what happened to that data, I was looking into why something would happen to it at all.<br><br>Peters was the only person in my office who even knew that the data was going to be delivered to TPN today. She has been... terminated."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

