// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistanceBombClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2791799080" "Resistance Bomb"
// DetailString :
"P4255561934" "This massive bomb is linked to a strange device which emits a low energy pulse. The pulse appears to be what is turning the clockwork aggressive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CitizenClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2799892507" "There's a bomb!"
// DetailString :
"P4160043264" "According to the citizen you rescued, there is a massive bomb located in the middle of the park."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P181959095" "Now that you understand how far the tendrils of the Resistance have reached, I hope that you and I can see eye to eye on things.<br><br>Unlike other officials you may have met, I do not oppose the Resistance's methods, I oppose their message. This does, from time to time, force me to oppose their methods because it is my duty to ensure that their message goes unheard.<br><br>Your duty, as a member of the Powers Division, is to do the same. You wouldn't want to neglect your duties, would you?"
// AcceptString :
"P997663171" "Ask how you can serve the empire."
// SendOffString :
"P4071604561" "A loyal response for sure, but you will see why loyalty needs to be respected.<br><br>The Resistance has deployed a complex device in the People's Park. It is scrambling the override signals to the clockwork in the area, and drawing them to it to defend it. The device has a more sinister purpose, however, than simply robbing the city of its workers... it contains a nuclear warhead.<br><br>You will disarm this bomb while I ensure that the PPD evacuate all critical personnel from the surrounding area."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4116296772" "Save Imperial City"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3164011493" "I'm afraid I do not know when the Resistance plan on detonating their dirty bomb, but if I were you, I would assume that every second you waste is one less second to disarm that device."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1927549889" "All you have to do is disarm a nuclear warhead while fighting off an army of robots."

