// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2974894735" "You found something"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1333861494" "You rescued the hostages and disarmed the Resistance's dirty nuke in the middle of People's Park!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1927859857" "You performed spectacularly.<br><br>Now you understand the message of the Resistance. It's not about freedom, it's about fear. They're afraid that what we have is too good to be true, and so they are going to prove it.<br><br>Their method was an effective one; a dirty bomb from the old days; a barbaric weapon from a barbaric time when man's only enemy was himself. But those cowards forgot one thing... they forgot what a hero can do when the people are in danger.<br><br>The city owes its survival to you, {HeroName}, and TPN was there to capture your heroic deeds. It feels good, doesn't it? Embrace it, it's your reward for doing the right thing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL2.5_IC_Chimera_G_Task3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SoilSampleClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P617268746" "Soil Samples"
// DetailString :
"P3414891235" "These soil samples were taken from all around the People's Park. They look normal enough to you, but tests will show the chemical composition of whatever was on the Resistance members boots who were spotted in the park earlier, and then they can be tracked down."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3863521486" "Good detective work is a skill that has been lost to time, {HeroName}. Too many have relied on all that Emperor Cole has given them, and, in a perfect world, that would not be a fault.<br><br>But it isn't a perfect world, is it, {HeroName}? No, that is a fact that I have learned to live with, but one that is a sudden stark reality to the general populace.<br><br>The Resistance has embraced the old ways of violence, and chaos, to try and bring us down. So we will go down, down to their level, and play by their rules. Won't you embrace the old ways with me for awhile?"
// AcceptString :
"P1398982109" "Do things the old way"
// SendOffString :
"P404286407" "Good. The Resistance know all too well how we work. They've learned to avoid the seers, they hide where there are none to see them, but what they have not hidden, is where they have been. No, they make it painfully obvious where they have been, don't they?<br><br>And that is where good detective work shall come in, {HeroName}. The Resistance have recently been conducting activity in the People's Park. I want you to take some soil samples of their boot prints for me.<br><br>From that we will determine just where the Resistance has been stomping around down in the tunnels our feet."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4096976605" "Gather Soil Samples"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3248202232" "The sooner you get those soil samples for me, the more lives you will save."
// zowiedisplayname :
"P1835253141" "Soil Sample"
// zowiedescription :
"P598610176" "Recover{remain} soil samples"
// zowiesingulardescription :
"P293272763" "1 soil sample remaining"
// interactbeginstring :
"P2736695627" "You begin gathering a soil sample..."
// interactcompletestring :
"P1221900920" "You have finished gathering the sample."
// interactactionstring :
"P1365865147" "Gathering..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1227083449" "You've gotten all the Soil Samples. Return with them to Chimera."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2174568406" "I'll have these samples analyzed just as soon as I've finished analyzing the samples I collected from where you were standing.<br><br>Should they match... Well, I imagine that they won't, but if they do, we will have to have a few words, won't we?"

