// Clue Name :
"P17616482" "Colin Russo"
// DetailString :
"P2177473164" "It would seem that the Resistance wants Colin Russo bad. It would also seem that he wasn't very happy to see you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P926821857" "It has come to my attention, as things are want to do, that the Resistance is planning on attacking one of our Lethe prison barges. I want you to stop them."
// AcceptString :
"P3753886337" "Stop the Resistance attack."
// SendOffString :
"P2617570623" "There is more to this attack than meets the eye. One of the prisoners aboard must absolutely not escape. His name is Colin Russo, and he is a dangerous man.<br><br>Ensure that he doesn't escape. In fact, ensure that he doesn't leave there alive."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1063530749" "Stop Resistance Attack"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4179895581" "Colin Russo must die, and the Resistance must be taught a lesson. Get down there and defend that prison barge."

