// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2351225519" "You've stopped the Resistance attack and ensured that Colin Russo will never harm another citizen again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P201698829" "You can catch more flies with honey than with vinegar, {HeroName}.<br><br>I could have ordered Russo's death at any time during his brief stay in our prison system, but I chose to use him instead. By keeping him alive I kept hope alive in the Resistance. I let them believed there was still a chance to get their friend back. They were wrong. Dead wrong.<br><br>Remember this lesson well. The Resistance is an extraordinary gathering of rather ordinary people. That means they are weak, and easily manipulated by emotion. The greatest weapon we have in our arsenal against the Resistance... is the Resistance themselves."
